//   detail, the editor's Back is "Chat", one entry back.
//   And row 116, unseen-dot (the dots scene's seed; 1280x800 and 390x844 touch, dark and light, and at 1280x800 each
//   of the four looks in light and dark): the list's four dots in their colours with their words, the needs-you pulse
//   and Reduce motion, the badge; a turn that ends on a chat no page has open shows the unread dot in the accent, a
